OL,3,GNEWSANurses face 'postcode lottery' for
OL,4,Afree parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Varanica Whinfield, a
OL,7,Fcommunity nurse from Oldbury, was given
OL,8,Fa #100 fine for parking at Perry Barr
OL,9,FVillage while comforting a bereaved
OL,10,Ffamily, and Lisa Smith was fined at the
OL,11,Fsame location after getting stuck in a
OL,12,Flift while trying to treat a sick baby.
OL,14,FThe Royal College of Nursing said some
OL,15,Fcouncils had introduced permit schemes,
OL,16,Fbut that it was "far from universal".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
